{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3uhqLzAFQYur1fkRZR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*A single keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\n*You hold out a key.*\n\n*The door considers it.*\n\n...\n\n*The key is unnamed. Uncut. A concept without teeth.*\n\n**Which key?**\n\n*The keyhole waits, patient as stone. The tumblers inside are shaped like questions. The wards are carved from intent.*\n\n*Name the key. Shape it. Give it teeth.*\n\n*Then turn it.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":131,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}